# A ceiling at or above the request budget never fires: the budget refuses the
# request first, at fifteen seconds, which is the state this ended.

title: the ceiling on the wait is set past the request budget
file: cmd/pacioli/serve.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestTheHandlerIsGivenThePoolsCeiling -v ./cmd/pacioli/
--- before
	acquireGrace    = 2 * time.Second
--- after
	acquireGrace    = 20 * time.Second
